flowchart TD
    F{"Where did it fail?"} -->|"model call"| I{"Retryable?<br>429, 500, 504, 529,<br>connection, 409*"}
    F -->|"inside a tool"| TR["Infra error: retry<br>inside the tool"]
    TR -->|"retries run out"| TE["Error result:<br>what went wrong,<br>what to try next"]
